       "\n",
       "I recommend **rejecting the full fleet replacement** but pursuing a **phased hybrid-public model** that retains democratic control while selectively deploying autonomous vehicles (AVs) as a complementary service. This package prioritizes resilience infrastructure, maintains core public transit employment, expands service equity, and establishes robust regulatory oversight—while piloting AV technology under strict performance contracts tied to equity and climate outcomes.\n",
