      "# Response from competitor 4\n",
      "\n",
      "This is a complex, multi-dimensional policy challenge that requires balancing long-term resilience, equity, labor rights, fiscal prudence, and democratic governance. Below is my recommended policy package, along with alternatives, assumptions, uncertainties, quantitative projections, adaptive triggers, failure modes, and a reflexive note on my own limitations.\n",
      "\n",
